* How to use:
* 1. Copy entire file (from .title to .end)
* 2. Paste into EDA Playground (https://www.edaplayground.com)
* 3. Select "NGSPICE" as the simulator
* 4. Click "Run"
* 5. Check "Simulation" tab for waveforms
* 6. Modify component values to experiment with design
*
* Questions?
* - Check OPA2356 datasheet for actual parameters
* - Compare simulation results with recommended application circuit
* - Adjust Rf/Cf if stability not satisfactory
*
